@startuml state-refresh-token
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title SIMDP - State Diagram: RefreshToken Lifecycle

[*] --> ACTIVE : Login sukses\n(INSERT RefreshToken dengan hash)

ACTIVE --> REVOKED : Logout eksplisit\n(POST /api/v1/auth/logout)

ACTIVE --> REVOKED : Login baru (single-device enforcement)\n(Semua token lama di-revoke saat login)

ACTIVE --> ROTATED : Refresh token berhasil\n(token lama revoke, token baru dibuat)

ROTATED --> [*] : Token lama tercatat\nrevokedAt IS NOT NULL

ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : expiresAt < NOW()\n(tidak diperpanjang = 7 hari tidak aktif)

REVOKED --> [*] : Record tetap ada di DB\n(untuk audit trail)

EXPIRED --> [*] : Record tetap ada di DB

note right of ACTIVE
  Hanya satu token ACTIVE per user
  karena single-device enforcement.
end note

note right of ROTATED
  Saat refresh berhasil:
  1. Token lama di-revoke (revokedAt = NOW())
  2. Token baru di-insert (ACTIVE)
end note

@enduml
